 :title "cloud-itonami-isic-0113 (growing of vegetables and melons, roots and tubers) field-operations-coordination actor"
 :status :accepted
 :date "2026-07-15"
 :deciders ["Jun Kawasaki (agent-executed, standing authorization)"]
 :related ["ADR-2607122200" "ADR-2607011000" "ADR-2607152500" "ADR-2607152200"]

 :context
 "cloud-itonami-isic-0113 did not exist on GitHub at scaffold time (gh repo
  view 404) -- a fresh build, not a repair of a prior broken artifact. Built
  from cloud-itonami-isic-0111 (cereal growing) as the module-structure
  template, with clojure -M:test independently re-run before and after
  every push."

 :scope-exclusions
 ["direct field-equipment operation (farmer's exclusive authority)"
  "finalizing a pesticide-application decision (agronomist/farmer authority)"
  "agronomic decision authority -- what/when/how much to plant, spray, irrigate, harvest (remains human authority)"]

 :decision
 "Implement cloud-itonami-isic-0113 with Governor, Facts, Registry, Store, Advisor,
  Phase, Operation, Sim (mirrors cloud-itonami-isic-0111 module-for-module,
  namespace vegops.* in place of cerealops.*):
  - Governor (FieldOperationsGovernor): 5 hard checks (field-not-registered,
    no-execution, equipment-or-pesticide-decision-blocked, op-not-allowed,
    field-record-invalid) + 3 escalation gates (always-escalate crop-health
    concern, cost-threshold supply orders, low confidence < 0.7)
  - Facts: supply categories with cost thresholds (seed/fertilizer/equipment),
    vegetable/root/tuber crops (tomato/cucumber/cabbage/onion/carrot/potato/
    sweet-potato/watermelon -- excludes cereals, rice, sugar cane, grapes)
  - Registry: independent pure predicates (cost-exceeds-threshold?,
    acreage-non-positive?, confidence-below-floor?)
  - Store: Store protocol + MemStore (registered-field lookup)
  - Advisor: Advisor protocol + MockAdvisor (4 ops)
  - Phase: 0->3 rollout gate
  - Operation: composes advisor -> governor -> phase-gate (langgraph-clj wiring
    deferred, matching 0111/0141's own stub)
  - Sim: demo runner with a working -main
  - Operations: log-field-record, schedule-field-operation,
    flag-crop-health-concern (pest/disease/frost-damage), order-supplies
    (closed allowlist, :effect :propose)
  - Tests: 30 tests / 99 assertions (facts, governor, phase, registry, store), all green
  - All .cljc (portable, no JVM interop), AGPL-3.0-or-later
  - README/business-model/operator-guide describe the real API"

 :consequences
 {:positive
  ["Vegetable/melon/root/tuber growing (0113) now genuinely implemented and
    fully tested"
   "Scope boundaries (field-equipment operation, pesticide-application decisions)
    hardcoded in governor checks, not just asserted in prose"
   "Crop-health escalation (flag-crop-health-concern always human) is a core
    design invariant"
   "Portable .cljc, zero JVM-only constructs, clj-kondo 0 errors / 0 warnings"]
  :negative
  ["Real persistent store (Datomic/kotoba-server) is a follow-up (in-memory for now)"
   "langgraph-clj StateGraph wiring (real interrupt-before/checkpoint resume) is
    deferred scaffolding, matching 0111/0141's own stub status"]}

